{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/reviews/id1101564062"}, "name":{"label":"JohnnyLi10"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-07-26T07:08:41-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.2.7"}, "id":{"label":"8913730214"}, "title":{"label":"Amazing app"}, "content":{"label":"Amazed\n\nAs soon as I downloaded the app, I loved the design that it had. It has all the features you could ask for.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/reviews/id1213977366"}, "name":{"label":"desttt12345"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-07-12T04:42:38-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.2.6"}, "id":{"label":"8865965434"}, "title":{"label":"LOVE IT!  ⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve never left a review for any other app but this one…. I had to because it’s that AMAZING! Some of the things I love about the app is:\n\n-  ‘Inbox’ I love that I can brain dump everything here and schedule a time and date when it has one but it keeps it of my head so I’m not stressing about it. \n- ‘Subtask’ I love that I can have a main heading and have all these little tasks listed under it which makes it look/ feel less overwhelming because you can’t actually see them on the calendar view. \n- It’s super cute!!! The colours, icons…. EVERYTHING! \n- Being able to see gaps in between tasks so you can maximise your time. Also the little motivational sayings to fill your time. \n\nI’ve downloaded so many productivity/ organisation apps but I would always fall out of using them because they never had all the features needed to keep using it BUT this one does!!!! Super impressed", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/reviews/id23649821"}, "name":{"label":"knitkntifrog"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-06-27T21:47:47-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.2.5"}, "id":{"label":"8817899807"}, "title":{"label":"works well"}, "content":{"label":"I am only a week in, but what this app does is drag in my calendar appointments (teaching and meetings) and then i can schedule the remaining time for the things i need to do. For each task you set a length, which forces me to consider how long things take to do. Then i can see that i have planned to do way more than i can find time for and i replan - that simple little process makes me much more aware of my plans vs my time. highly recommend and will go pro at some point.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
