{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/reviews/id31585245"}, "name":{"label":"Sawadi"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-05-22T16:18:29-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.2.2"}, "id":{"label":"8698347324"}, "title":{"label":"Great app!"}, "content":{"label":"I have Aspergers and find this app a really useful way to structure my days and remind me to to things when they need doing.\nIt is sophisticated without being unduly complex and is not, like so many similar concepts, aimed entirely at the world of work and offices - it works great to structure your day both personally and professionally.\nI would like to be able to see the week in a single view though.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/reviews/id470847953"}, "name":{"label":"JdksksnwaKba"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-05-21T10:01:33-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.2.2"}, "id":{"label":"8693979668"}, "title":{"label":"Amazing"}, "content":{"label":"I never leave an review, but this app has amazing customer service and is really helpful. I need to organise everything so it has been my go-to for a while now. Highly highly recommend", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/reviews/id278661755"}, "name":{"label":"kookingbacon"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-05-17T13:12:45-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.2.2"}, "id":{"label":"8681146933"}, "title":{"label":"The best"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve never had an app like this. I realised the best scheduling technique was to write a vague plan the night before then make it a schedule the next morning. Ever since I’ve done this, my life has been a lot less stressful and I miss less deadlines. Structured has made this so seamless and easy with the Inbox functionality, and the smart icons make it extremely fast to make a task without the hassle of thinking about customisation. Thank you Leo!!!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/reviews/id1361652105"}, "name":{"label":"blackberryandbay9"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-05-09T01:28:57-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.2.2"}, "id":{"label":"8652657848"}, "title":{"label":"Structured is so well-structured."}, "content":{"label":"This is an amazing app for organisation and it’s free!! I highly recommend this app, as a student it gets hard to manage my time and it’s nice to have something to keep everything on track. It’s also really fun that we can experiment with colours and different icons for each task. I also enjoy how if there is a gap between tasks, the motivational questions like “What can we do in a 30 minute break?” is very motivating and makes me wish to fill out the gap with work. Highly recommend to any busy person, you need this app in your life. \nAmelia", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/reviews/id259448453"}, "name":{"label":"Loolabum"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-04-20T18:27:17-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.2.1"}, "id":{"label":"8589255968"}, "title":{"label":"Love it - but would love to be able to click and drag"}, "content":{"label":"App has made my life so much more organised, especially as I can link my calendar. \n\nI would like to be able to drag/move my items around to rearrange them so I don't need to close the item and check timings of the other ones before changing times. This would make it much easier to rearrange my day during the hustle and bustle.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/reviews/id1055176490"}, "name":{"label":"Scarly😍😍🤩🤩😍😍🤩🤩"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-04-14T21:23:21-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.2.1"}, "id":{"label":"8568605803"}, "title":{"label":"I love this app!!"}, "content":{"label":"I have always said that I wanted to be more productive and I have I tried using paper calendars and so many calendar apps but I just give up now that I have an app that is so simple and easy it makes things so much funnier! I would so recommend this app.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
