{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/reviews/id1345973494"}, "name":{"label":"Saytz_84051"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-03-12T13:37:06-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.1.3"}, "id":{"label":"8448804787"}, "title":{"label":"Aesthetic, easy to use, afforable"}, "content":{"label":"This is really smooth and simple to use, plus its aesthetic, there's a decent amount of customization too - for the tasks you can just use a color wheel, the 'pro' version is a one time (very afforable) purchase instead of a sneaky subscription which is a blessing\n\nIts a relatively new app so I dont want to come across as harsh, it'd be nice if there was a way to have a weekly/monthly view, the icons could perhaps be sorted into catagories or sorted by recent use, but its in developement still and I know these are pretty minor things \n\nThank you heaps for this great app!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/reviews/id206659191"}, "name":{"label":"JustBolt"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-03-10T02:16:44-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.1.2"}, "id":{"label":"8439786657"}, "title":{"label":"Really good organisation app"}, "content":{"label":"I have only used this app for a day but I feel so relieved being able to see my tasks presented to me in a clear and orderly fashion. I really like the way the developer has added a section for tasks which don’t have a current time slots. However, I think it would be a nice addition if the task blocks were able to be dragged around and added or taken out of the day planner or inbox. :)", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
